## Installation

```bash
npm install project-name
```

## Quick Start

```javascript
import { compile } from 'project-name';

const html = compile(`# Hello World`);
console.log(html);
```

## Key Features

- **Phase 9 Components**: Declarative `component`, `template`, `macro`, `slot`, and `fill` constructs.
- **Phase 10 Interactive Documents**: `@form`, `@quiz`, `@deck`, `@poll`, and `@tasks` widgets.
- **Native Spatial Layouts**: `@layout`, `@grid`, `@flex`, `@canvas`, and `@presentation`.
- **Vector Graphics & Math**: Native `@vector` drawing engine and TeX-compatible `@math`.

